n\n### 5. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. Provide the direct text file location [`file:///home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/REPORTS/FORENSIC_AUDIT_REPORT_DELETE_PROOF.txt`](file:///home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/REPORTS/FORENSIC_AUDIT_REPORT_DELETE_PROOF.txt) to Iraq Bhai.\n2. Also copy the `.txt` report into `/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/exports/` so Iraq Bhai can view or download it via `https://wallpaper-movements-lee-rep.trycloudflare.com/FORENSIC_AUDIT_REPORT_DELETE_PROOF.txt`.\n3. Await Iraq Bhai's review and decisions on what specific hardening steps (e.g. non-sudo service identity, systemd sandbox, global Landlock wrapper, ext4 directory immutability) he wishes to authorize.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Strictly AUDIT ONLY. No autonomous architectural redesigns or mock claims.\n- Never claim \"100% Delete-Proof\" without independent kernel-level and filesystem-level proof.\n- Pure Bengali response language addressing Iraq Bhai respectfully.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 2 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_40_points_test_report]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_40_points_test_report.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:48:38Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_architecture_implementation]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_architecture_implementation.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:26:43Z\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned during this conversation (up to 20).\nView the conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with them.\n\n{\n  \"spec\":  {\n    \"typeName\":  \"ask_and_research\",\n    \"role\":  \"Ask & Research Specialist\",\n    \"initialPrompt\":  \"অনুগ্রহ করে আপনার অ্যাক্টিভেশন যাচাই করুন, 